    "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong>·1月更新内容前瞻</strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"17dc781c7d2fab8a7908cc87fbf9943a\" title=\"1月前瞻.png\" alt=\"1月前瞻.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20241104/17dc781c7d2fab8a7908cc87fbf9943a.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong>·讲述者列表</strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"fdd655f45acff2c141310f7b730fb2d6\" title=\"1月月小队.png\" alt=\"1月月小队.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20241104/fdd655f45acff2c141310f7b730fb2d6.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>奇遇讲述者史尔特尔</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">弯路的终点。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·假说辑录</strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"4337aee81b295364860d3395350508a7\" title=\"1月奖励.png\" alt=\"1月奖励.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20241104/4337aee81b295364860d3395350508a7.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">假说辑录添加内容</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">假说辑录的等级上限提升至</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">140</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><strong>1月稀有奖励主题场景意塑</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">属于直觉、愿望、本能与臆想的无尽求索。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·本月委托栏</strong></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">本月委托栏将会覆盖一批委托。委托更新后，上月的委托进度将不会被继承。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">您将获得可在本月使用的四次刷新未完成委托的机会。点击刷新后，即可重新获得同等级的委托。</span></span></span></p>",
